SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU LV - Sticky Bun ride (28R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Bruce Black\
 n\n\\*\\*\\*PLEASE NOTE THE START TIME(s)\\*\\*\\*\n\nThat while the ths r
 ide starts at Landis Valley Farm Museum at 9:45\, **those wishing for extr
 a miles can begin at 9am at the Lititz Library**…For the people riding t
 o/from Lititz Library\, they will have 38 miles total. The route includes 
 a stop at Bird in Hand Bake Shop for some delicious sticky buns. The pace 
 will be 14 - 16 mph average. Multiple regroup points (like 4 or 5).\n\nThi
 s ride is a social ride\, but cyclists are not expected to stay in one gro
 up. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable paces. Please be supportiv
 e of the other cyclists to avoid anyone biking alone or being dropped off 
 the back of the last group.\n\nCue and Ride with GPS links:\n[https://ride
 withgps.com/routes/55094346](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/55094346)\n\nH
 elmets are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and a
  basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nBeing a
  Meetup Member does not mean you are a club member. Use this link to join 
 the club.\n[https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club
 _id=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club
 _id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Co
 nduct [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_i
 d=257148&module_id=323984](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.as
 px?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\nand Rules of the Road\n[ht
 tps://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?](https://lancbikeclub.clu
 bexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)
