SUMMARY:Phil's Hills: Bricker Repeats
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride Leader:** Phil New
 swanger\n\n**Phil’s Hills**: a series of structured hill repeat rides de
 signed to build strength\, endurance and boost your overall fitness.\n\n**
 Route link:** [Phil's Hills: Bricker Repeats](https://ridewithgps.com/rout
 es/52729187)\n**PDF link:** [Cuesheet](https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/
 assets.modomadethis.com/cuesheets/Phils_Hills_Bricker_Repeats.pdf)\n\nWhat
  to Expect:\n\n* **Route:** Expect a total distance of approximately **15-
 20 miles**\, including **3-4 loops** of a circuit featuring **1-2 climbing
  segment**.\n* **Focus:** We'll emphasize maintaining a consistent climbin
 g tempo\, active recovery between efforts\, and repeating the effort to bu
 ild power and efficiency.\n* **Pace:** We'll maintain a comfortable averag
 e pace range of **14-16 mph**.\n* **No-Drop Policy:** You'll never be left
  behind! We'll regroup after climbs to ensure everyone stays together.\n\n
 \\-\\-\\-\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds or audible music-playing de
 vices. Please bring water\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire leve
 rs\, pump/CO2 inflator).
